round 3: owners watchlist-store=ok; oracle GREEN
governor turn 4: accept  (Oracle is green (tsc clean, 34 tests passing) and the feature is in place: WatchlistStore.clearWatched() removes watched items and the watchlist component exposes a 'Clear watched' button wired to it, as pinned by the acceptance tests.)

